WEBVTT

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:06.123 align:center line:88%
You log your meals. You wear a watch. You get blood tests.

00:00:06.183 --> 00:00:08.434 align:center line:88%
But none of it talks to each other.

00:00:08.494 --> 00:00:12.207 align:center line:88%
Healthings connects all of it into one loop.

00:00:12.267 --> 00:00:18.952 align:center line:88%
It starts in the clinic. A licensed nutritionist reads your labs and sets your plan.

00:00:19.012 --> 00:00:23.074 align:center line:88%
That plan becomes rules that live inside your app.

00:00:23.134 --> 00:00:28.240 align:center line:88%
Your scale, your watch, and your CGM keep the numbers honest.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:32.838 align:center line:88%
Every meal you log is checked against your plan, in seconds.

00:00:32.898 --> 00:00:38.097 align:center line:88%
And your clinic sees the real week, not a story from memory, and adjusts.

00:00:38.157 --> 00:00:42.741 align:center line:88%
Clinic directs. App executes. Devices measure.

00:00:42.801 --> 00:00:45.936 align:center line:88%
Healthings. One loop, closed.
